{"ref":"BDB, זִמְרִי","hw":"זִמְרִי","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זִמְרִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊 Ζαμβρ(ε)ι—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a Simeoneite <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:14\" href=\"/Numbers.25.14\">Nu 25:14</a> (P).<br><strong>2.</strong>  grandson of Judah <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.6\">2 Ch 2:6</a> (app. = <span dir=\"rtl\">זַבְדִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:1\" href=\"/Joshua.7.1\">Jos 7:1</a> q.v.)<br><strong>3.</strong>  king of Isr. before Omri <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.9\">1 K 16:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:10\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.20\">20</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:31\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.31\">2 K 9:31</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.36\">1 Ch 8:36</a><sup>(×2)</sup> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.42\">9:42</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.","next":"BDB, זִמְרִי²","prev":"BDB, זֶ֫מֶר"}